<title>USA: Bangladesh buys 100,000T op-origin wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh buys 100,000T op-origin wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh bought 100,000 tonnes of optional-origin wheat for December shipment during its weekend tender for 200,000 tonnes, said U.S. exporters.</p>
<p>Prices were unavailable. One exporter said the wheat will likely come from Australia and another said &quot;it probably won't be U.S.&quot;</p>
<p>The status of the remaining 100,000 tonnes was not known early Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
